ixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Adds move_and_push() functions to CharacterBody3D and CharacterBody2D.\r\n---------\r\n\r\n### Reason: There are situations where you want players to push objects as they collide. \r\n------\r\n\r\n\r\n- move_and_push() internally call move_and_slide() but applies an impulse to any rigid bodies that collides with the player\r\n\r\n- Scaling with multiplier variable and PhysicsMaterial bounce value\r\n\r\n- Adds collision multiplier to scale the impulse caused by the player\r\n\r\n- Adds material presets to PhysicsMaterial\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13211*\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-18T06:43:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T18:20:08Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T18:19:32Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"11c5b0a009745b86da409625b3f146bf9fe292b9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"me-steven:master","ref":"master","repo":null,"